":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducable in 1586c5674bbafe1d7f4bd457d446f132b475890c\n- Last worked in Godot 4.3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6900 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.12033.1030) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe 'Show in FileSystem' functionality does not work under certain conditions. Writing a path into the FileSystem and pressing ENTER also suffers from the same problem.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be45dc65-81b9-4d32-97a3-a53172125dd5\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a folder `dice`.\n- Create three GDScripts in that folder:\n  - `dice.gd`, `attack_dice.gd`, `def_dice.gd`\n- Open `dice.gd`\n- Right click in the Script List -> `Show in FileSystem`\n- FileSystem jumps to `attack_dice.gd`\n\nSame when pasting `res://dice/dice.gd` into the file line edit (`attack_dice.gd` is selected).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[repro_2025-02-02_21-08-45.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18633720/repro_2025-02-02_21-08-45.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https:/